        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146803,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu <code>for</code> döngüsü <code>1</code>'den <code>5</code>'e doğru artarak sayar. Oyunlarda, yeniden doğma zamanlayıcısında olduğu gibi, geri sayım da yaparız. <code>5</code>'ten <code>1</code>'e doğru geri sayacak şekilde değiştir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146804,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Önce, sayaç değişkenini <code>5</code> olarak ayarlayarak döngünün nerede başladığını değiştireceğiz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146805,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sonra, döngünün <strong>durmasını</strong> sağlayacak şekilde koşulu, <code>i</code> değerinin <code>0</code> değerinden büyük olduğu duruma değiştireceğiz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>i</code>, ardından <code>&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>0</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayaç değişkenini artırmak yerine <code>i--</code> ile azaltırız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i--</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geri sayım yaparken <code>0</code>'ı da dahil etmek için (<code>0</code> saniye kaldığını göstermek gibi), <code>&gt;</code> yerine <code>&gt;=</code> kullanırız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146808,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu döngünün kod bloğunu çalıştırmadığını nasıl biliyoruz?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"-71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Döngü başladığında sayaç değişkeninin değeri <code>0</code>'dan küçüktür</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Döngünün kod bloğunu çalıştırıp çalıştırmadığını anlayamıyoruz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Döngü başladığında sayaç değişkeninin değeri <code>0</code>'dan küçüktür.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulda <code>i &gt; 0</code> kullandığımızda ne olur?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Döngü, <code>i</code> değerinin <code>0</code>'dan büyük olduğu sürece devam eder</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Döngü çalışmıyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Döngü, <code>i</code> değerinin <code>0</code>'dan büyük olduğu sürece devam eder.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu döngünün aşağı doğru saydığını nasıl biliriz?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i--</code> parantezlerin içinde</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">  Parantezlerin içinde <code>i++</code> var</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i--</code> parantezlerin içinde.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>5</code>'ten <code>0</code>'a geri sayım</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code>'ten <code>1</code>'e geri sayım</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code>'ten <code>0</code>'a geri sayım.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>for döngüsünün çalışması için counter değişkenini oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-5\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodun <code>i &gt; 5</code> olsun; böylece döngü <code>i</code> değeri <code>5</code>'ten büyük olduğunda çalışır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;High score bonus countdown:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i &gt; 5</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
